WEBVTT

00:16.710 --> 00:21.250
<b>Now that college is starting,
there are two goals I want to accomplish:</b>

00:22.000 --> 00:25.210
<b>First, I want to learn how to better handle
my supernatural sensitivity.</b>

00:25.630 --> 00:30.330
<b>Second, I want to get my social skills
back to what they were before the curse.</b>

00:30.630 --> 00:36.880
<b>Welcome, freshmen! If you're looking
for Reio Club Shore, we're meeting here!</b>

00:39.790 --> 00:45.960
<b>I'm handling my sensitivity by training my body
to be tough enough to resist spirits.</b>

00:47.380 --> 00:48.460
<b>As for my social skills...</b>

00:51.580 --> 00:52.920
<b>What do you think?</b>

00:52.920 --> 00:54.750
<b>Hey, that looks good!</b>

00:54.750 --> 00:57.380
<b>Not too flashy, doesn't make you look like
you're trying too hard.</b>

00:57.540 --> 00:59.290
<b>You look super approachable!</b>

00:59.630 --> 01:02.830
<b>You can change that much with just an outfit?</b>

01:02.830 --> 01:05.080
<b>It's less the outfit and more the impression.</b>

01:05.290 --> 01:11.290
<b>Wear the right thing at the right time and place,
and people will warm right up to you.</b>

01:11.540 --> 01:14.830
<b>Thanks. I'm glad I had you to help, Eiko.</b>

01:14.960 --> 01:15.880
<b>No prob!</b>

01:16.420 --> 01:17.420
<b>Okay...</b>

01:18.630 --> 01:19.830
<b>Now for the finishing touch!</b>

01:20.670 --> 01:21.580
<b>Glasses?</b>

01:21.750 --> 01:26.130
<b>Just frames. They'll make you look really smart.</b>

01:27.250 --> 01:28.040
<b>Okay...</b>

01:28.880 --> 01:30.830
<b>Now you're looking fashionable!</b>

01:31.460 --> 01:33.580
<b>You're gonna crush it at the welcome event tomorrow!</b>

01:34.380 --> 01:38.130
<b>Today, I'm finally going to make some friends!</b>

03:19.210 --> 03:21.290
<b>Hey, you a new freshman?</b>

03:21.790 --> 03:25.750
<b>I'm the president of Shore. Name's Nagayama.
Glad you're here with us!</b>

03:26.420 --> 03:28.040
<b>You a travel fan?</b>

03:28.210 --> 03:30.670
<b>Oh, uh, I...</b>

03:32.000 --> 03:35.830
<b>I'm here to make friends I can travel places with!</b>

03:36.250 --> 03:41.170
<b>Sounds like a plan. Stick around and you just might!</b>

03:41.460 --> 03:42.880
<b>G-great!</b>

03:44.040 --> 03:45.500
<b>I can do this!</b>

03:47.500 --> 03:51.380
<b>Let's go catch some scary spirits
and get them to kill some really bad ones.</b>

03:52.170 --> 03:52.920
<b>Together.</b>

03:54.000 --> 03:57.710
<b>I want to kill the spirit that cursed us.</b>

03:58.420 --> 04:01.750
<b>And to do that, we need to catch powerful spirits.</b>

04:02.460 --> 04:05.580
<b>Then, Eiko and I will be free of its curse.</b>

04:06.130 --> 04:11.500
<b>But that means diving deep into the world
of the supernatural and putting myself in danger.</b>

04:12.580 --> 04:16.500
<b>And when I think of how Eiko will want to help me,
it's not easy to make that choice.</b>

04:17.380 --> 04:22.210
<b>So today, I'm gonna do everything I can
to get back to living a normal life!</b>

04:22.830 --> 04:27.960
<b>Once I've got myself a head start on that,
I'll figure out my plan and tell Yayoi-chan!</b>

04:33.580 --> 04:37.420
<b>Oh, uh, I...</b>

04:37.420 --> 04:41.250
<b>I'm here to make friends I can travel places with!</b>

04:42.130 --> 04:43.790
<b>Eiko, bathroom's open.</b>

04:43.790 --> 04:45.540
<b>COMING!</b>

04:47.500 --> 04:49.040
<b>What did you just hide?</b>

04:49.830 --> 04:51.630
<b>N-nothing!</b>

04:51.960 --> 04:53.670
<b>Are you crying?</b>

04:55.920 --> 04:59.290
<b>Yeah. It's something Kei-kun said...</b>

04:59.790 --> 05:02.290
<b>REIO UNIVERSITY</b>

05:01.130 --> 05:02.210
<b>Eiko...</b>

05:03.710 --> 05:09.130
<b>I know enough people at school now
to have acquaintances to wave to in the halls...</b>

05:09.630 --> 05:14.880
<b>But they're all your friends! Or friends of your friends!</b>

05:15.330 --> 05:19.290
<b>And it sucks! I can literally feel we're not actually friends!</b>

05:19.540 --> 05:23.790
<b>I need to make myself some friends of my own!</b>

05:24.080 --> 05:27.130
<b>That's how I become a functioning member of society!</b>

05:27.540 --> 05:30.540
<b>And now he's off on his own...</b>

05:31.170 --> 05:32.670
<b>That sounds like a good thing.</b>

05:33.250 --> 05:35.290
<b>It is, but I'm a little sad.</b>

05:35.790 --> 05:40.460
<b>But I helped him get some nicer clothes
and gave him a pair of glasses!</b>

05:43.000 --> 05:44.040
<b>Yayoi-chan?!</b>

05:44.040 --> 05:46.330
<b>YAYOI-CHAN!</b>

05:46.540 --> 05:50.790
<b>Well, well, well, what do we have here? Hmm?</b>

05:51.170 --> 05:55.170
<b>I-I'm Keitaro Gentoga, first-year Humanities student!</b>

05:56.250 --> 05:58.170
<b>You're a tech whiz, Eiko.</b>

05:58.540 --> 06:00.330
<b>I-I wouldn't say I'm a whiz...</b>

06:00.580 --> 06:04.460
<b>I think I get the gist. This program I'm looking at tracks:</b>

06:04.790 --> 06:08.380
<b>audio and video feeds, a heart and breath rate
and temperature monitor,</b>

06:08.380 --> 06:10.580
<b>and a bunch of other information to keep watch on him.</b>

06:10.920 --> 06:15.380
<b>The glasses you said you gave him
must have a camera in them. Did I guess right?</b>

06:18.130 --> 06:19.880
<b>Do you like Keitaro, Eiko?</b>

06:20.580 --> 06:21.210
<b>I sure do!</b>

06:21.210 --> 06:24.210
<b>Yikes. I love you, but this is a big yikes.</b>

06:25.750 --> 06:27.540
<b>Where did you even get something like this?</b>

06:27.920 --> 06:29.500
<b>I-I made it.</b>

06:29.830 --> 06:30.710
<b>Wow!</b>

06:31.210 --> 06:32.460
<b>Still, yikes.</b>

06:34.170 --> 06:35.130
<b>Die.</b>

06:36.830 --> 06:39.210
<b>Die, die, die...</b>

06:39.210 --> 06:40.790
<b>Is that a spirit?
</b><b>Die, die, die...</b><b></b>

06:41.000 --> 06:43.250
<b>Yeah, whenever I spy on-</b>

06:44.580 --> 06:48.330
<b>I mean check in on him,
I can always hear something like that.</b>

06:51.250 --> 06:53.500
<b>You're just gonna say "yikes" again...</b>

06:53.670 --> 06:56.710
<b>Eiko, love is a beautiful emotion.</b>

06:57.130 --> 06:59.080
<b>That's not the impression you were giving me.</b>

06:59.290 --> 07:03.710
<b>I wasn't in my right mind.
I'm here to help, however you need me.</b>

07:07.000 --> 07:07.630
<b>CHIPS</b>

07:07.630 --> 07:11.080
<b>Hello, everyone, and welcome to Spying on Kei-kun!</b>

07:11.080 --> 07:13.710
<b>I'm your host, Eiko Hozuki!</b>

07:13.710 --> 07:21.670
<b>Here with me is analyst and extreme
occult enjoyer Yayoi Hozuki-chan!</b>

07:21.880 --> 07:22.830
<b>Thanks for having me.</b>

07:23.000 --> 07:27.170
<b>Okay, Yayoi-chan, do you think Kei-kun
will be able to make friends today?</b>

07:27.290 --> 07:29.960
<b>I'm excited to see just how badly he's going to screw up.</b>

07:30.080 --> 07:36.540
<b>Wow! So you don't think he's going to succeed
in the slightest! Talk about harsh!</b>

07:36.540 --> 07:39.210
<b>Let's get back to the feed and see what's going on!</b>

07:40.130 --> 07:41.580
<b>The anticipation is killing me.</b>

07:49.540 --> 07:51.580
<b>I'm going to make some new friends!</b>

07:52.380 --> 07:55.170
<b>But who do I talk to?</b>

07:55.580 --> 07:59.750
<b>Whoa-ho! He's freaking out about who to start talking to!</b>

07:59.920 --> 08:02.210
<b>Let's see what Keitaro will do!</b>

08:04.170 --> 08:07.880
<b>H-hey, I'm Keitaro Gentoga, I'm a Humanities major.</b>

08:07.880 --> 08:09.960
<b>H-how about you guys?</b>

08:10.330 --> 08:13.630
<b>He chickened out! C'mon, Keitaro, don't chicken out!</b>

08:13.630 --> 08:17.210
<b>He couldn't pick one, so he went for both!</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:19.790
<b>I'm Akira Ike. I'm studying law.</b>

08:20.040 --> 08:23.170
<b>I'm Kotoko Taira, I'm majoring in econ.</b>

08:24.170 --> 08:26.880
<b>We're totally different majors!
What do we even talk about?!</b>

08:27.040 --> 08:29.210
<b>Wh-why'd you check out this club?</b>

08:29.670 --> 08:31.250
<b>We both like traveling.</b>

08:31.380 --> 08:33.040
<b>Yeah, that tracks...</b>

08:33.330 --> 08:36.170
<b>I love travel. I-I wanna see Kyoto.</b>

08:36.750 --> 08:38.960
<b>Y-yeah, Kyoto is great.</b>

08:38.960 --> 08:39.830
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

08:41.250 --> 08:43.670
<b>Wh-where do I go from here?!</b>

08:43.960 --> 08:49.000
<b>Oh, no! Poor Keitaro doesn't know
the "How About You?" technique!</b>

08:49.210 --> 08:50.670
<b>And what's that technique?</b>

08:50.880 --> 08:54.290
<b>It's an easy way to keep a conversation going
by responding with simple quips like:</b>

08:50.880 --> 08:54.920
<b>"How about you?"</b>

08:51.920 --> 08:54.920
<b>"Why's that?"</b>

08:53.330 --> 08:54.920
<b>"What do you think?"</b>

08:54.290 --> 08:59.420
<b>"How about you?", "Why's that?", or "What do you think?"</b>

09:01.210 --> 09:05.540
<b>It's an excellent strategy,
but it's too tough for our little Keitaro!</b>

09:05.920 --> 09:09.920
<b>Kei-kun really can't do anything without my help!</b>

09:09.920 --> 09:11.540
<b>Kind of sounds like you like that.</b>

09:14.080 --> 09:16.210
<b>Hey, sounds like you're havin' a rough time.</b>

09:16.420 --> 09:20.750
<b>Oh! N-no, I'm okay...</b>

09:22.880 --> 09:26.500
<b>A bunch of us are gonna go out afterwards. You want in?</b>

09:27.880 --> 09:30.790
<b>It'll be a good chance to get to know more people.</b>

09:30.880 --> 09:33.920
<b>Whoa, now that is a huge opportunity!</b>

09:33.920 --> 09:36.170
<b>And you can hear the crowd agrees!</b>

09:36.420 --> 09:38.710
<b>Y-yeah, that would be great!</b>

09:38.710 --> 09:39.170
<b>Sweet!</b>

09:44.080 --> 09:46.630
<b>Gentoga-kun! Over here!</b>

09:47.380 --> 09:48.380
<b>Hello!</b>

09:48.790 --> 09:52.290
<b>H-hey, thanks for inviting me along!</b>

09:53.170 --> 09:54.750
<b>Wait, are you okay to drive?</b>

09:54.960 --> 09:56.630
<b>Yeah, I don't drink.</b>

09:56.830 --> 09:58.460
<b>Okay, let's go!</b>

10:00.710 --> 10:02.040
<b>Here, this'll help you sober up.</b>

10:02.630 --> 10:05.580
<b>Though you freshmen aren't old enough
to need to sober up, huh?</b>

10:05.920 --> 10:07.630
<b>Th-thanks, I'll have some.</b>

10:10.130 --> 10:11.380
<b>Where's your apartment?</b>

10:11.630 --> 10:14.130
<b>Over in Complex T. You know the building?</b>

10:14.130 --> 10:15.000
<b>No.</b>

10:15.000 --> 10:17.130
<b>Here I thought everyone knew about it.</b>

10:18.420 --> 10:20.000
<b>Wh-whoa...</b>

10:21.420 --> 10:22.500
<b>You okay?</b>

10:22.500 --> 10:24.290
<b>Y-yeah, just...</b>

10:24.920 --> 10:33.290
<b>This is gonna sound weird, but I-I'm pretty sensitive
to the supernatural, and I just got a wicked chill...</b>

10:33.540 --> 10:34.580
<b>Oh...?</b>

10:35.420 --> 10:40.670
<b>Then I've got the perfect story to tell you, Gentoga-kun.</b>

10:40.670 --> 10:41.540
<b>Huh?</b>

10:41.920 --> 10:45.830
<b>You see, there's a Suicide Club here at Reio U...</b>

10:47.630 --> 10:51.710
<b>So these creeps at Reio pretend to be a normal club,</b>

10:51.710 --> 10:57.790
<b>but during their welcome party,
they all commit mass suicide.</b>

10:58.380 --> 11:03.460
<b>W-wait, but if that club was a real thing,
the University would shut it down...</b>

11:03.830 --> 11:11.670
<b>Well, yeah, but they always change their name
and pretend to be a totally different club.</b>

11:11.920 --> 11:14.460
<b>You never know who they're hiding as...</b>

11:14.750 --> 11:19.630
<b>Unless you spot the one thing they all have in common.</b>

11:20.380 --> 11:21.710
<b>What's that?</b>

11:22.960 --> 11:25.880
<b>There's one name that always appears in their roster.</b>

11:26.130 --> 11:30.500
<b>They're the guy behind the club,
so you just need to arrest him to stop them, right?</b>

11:31.500 --> 11:34.630
<b>But no one ever did,</b>

11:35.500 --> 11:40.460
<b>because he always dies in the mass suicide.</b>

11:41.040 --> 11:46.670
<b>Then, the next year, someone else with that name
shows up to continue their legacy.</b>

11:47.710 --> 11:52.500
<b>The name of this elusive ringleader is none other than...</b>

11:55.670 --> 11:56.790
<b>...Nagayama.</b>

11:59.080 --> 11:59.750
<b>Wait...</b>

12:01.210 --> 12:03.920
<b>I'm the President of Shore. Name's Nagayama.</b>

12:05.540 --> 12:07.500
<b>You're kidding, right?</b>

12:13.540 --> 12:14.540
<b>He's possessed!</b>

12:16.580 --> 12:18.580
<b>Wh-what's happening?</b>

12:19.290 --> 12:22.290
<b>Why am I so sleepy...?</b>

12:37.750 --> 12:38.420
<b>Eiko.</b>

12:39.630 --> 12:44.670
<b>This guy wasn't kidding around,
and he's not some murderous predator.</b>

12:45.580 --> 12:46.920
<b>He's being possessed by a ghost.</b>

12:47.540 --> 12:48.830
<b>Keitaro's in trouble.</b>

12:49.880 --> 12:51.000
<b>We need to rescue him.</b>

13:15.960 --> 13:18.630
<b>Where am I...?</b>

13:20.670 --> 13:21.880
<b>What's that noise?</b>

13:36.170 --> 13:38.250
<b>Okay, it's your turn.</b>

13:39.380 --> 13:41.290
<b>Want me to help?</b>

13:44.170 --> 13:45.460
<b>I looked up Complex T.</b>

13:45.880 --> 13:53.920
<b>Back in the 1980s, there were 133 suicides there.</b>

13:50.040 --> 13:54.000
<b>133 suicides occurred at...</b>

13:54.210 --> 13:56.290
<b>A-a hundred and thirty-three?!</b>

13:56.540 --> 14:02.210
<b>This spirit behind those suicides convinces living humans
to take their own lives.</b>

14:02.670 --> 14:06.710
<b>But why did it decide to go after clubs at Reio U?</b>

14:08.080 --> 14:12.080
<b>Well, Complex T must be pretty close to T Station, right?</b>

14:12.290 --> 14:12.750
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:13.130 --> 14:15.630
<b>It's along the line that goes to campus,</b>

14:13.210 --> 14:14.750
<b>M Station</b>

14:13.210 --> 14:14.750
<b>Campus</b>

14:15.420 --> 14:21.460
<b>Complex T</b>

14:15.420 --> 14:21.460
<b>Student Residents</b>

14:15.420 --> 14:21.460
<b>T Station</b>

14:15.630 --> 14:17.710
<b>so I'd assume lots of Reio students live there.</b>

14:18.500 --> 14:22.630
<b>It could possess a student, then join a popular club</b>

14:22.290 --> 14:25.290
<b>M Station</b>

14:22.290 --> 14:25.290
<b>Campus</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:24.540
<b>and get them to commit mass suicide.</b>

14:24.710 --> 14:26.670
<b>And if the spirit's name is Nagayama,</b>

14:25.290 --> 14:26.710
<b>I'm Nagayama!</b>

14:26.830 --> 14:30.250
<b>then that would explain why Nagayama shows up
as a new person every time,</b>

14:30.460 --> 14:33.960
<b>because he's possessing someone new.</b>

14:34.380 --> 14:35.210
<b>That makes sense.</b>

14:35.580 --> 14:39.460
<b>Still, what does it accomplish
by leading a bunch of people to their deaths?</b>

14:39.670 --> 14:40.960
<b>I have an idea,</b>

14:42.790 --> 14:45.380
<b>but I'll know once we get there.</b>

14:48.880 --> 14:52.710
<b>C'mon, we're almost done. Don't fight it now.</b>

14:56.130 --> 14:57.380
<b>Eiko, hurry!</b>

14:57.790 --> 14:58.380
<b>I know!</b>

15:01.920 --> 15:05.830
<b>MACHIDA</b>

15:02.290 --> 15:03.170
<b>This is it!</b>

15:05.420 --> 15:06.630
<b>But the door's locked...</b>

15:09.790 --> 15:10.580
<b>Not anymore.</b>

15:10.580 --> 15:12.790
<b>Really?! That was easy!</b>

15:12.790 --> 15:14.290
<b>Only 'cause it's an old door.</b>

15:14.710 --> 15:18.130
<b>You go get Keitaro! I'll deal with the ghost!</b>

15:18.130 --> 15:19.290
<b>Wait... Hey!</b>

15:25.080 --> 15:26.080
<b>Kei-kun!</b>

15:26.880 --> 15:28.540
<b>Wh-what are they doing here?!</b>

15:33.880 --> 15:35.630
<b>You shouldn't be in here.</b>

15:35.830 --> 15:38.630
<b>How the heck did you get in here, sweetheart?</b>

15:42.250 --> 15:43.500
<b>GOLD FLAKE SAKE</b>

15:44.750 --> 15:46.250
<b>GOLD FLAKE SAKE</b>

15:54.000 --> 15:56.080
<b>I got the demon out of him.</b>

15:56.380 --> 15:57.000
<b>But...</b>

16:01.210 --> 16:04.170
<b>You little shit...</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:07.960
<b>Die! Die, you bastards!</b>

16:09.250 --> 16:13.130
<b>I'll die, you'll die, everyone is going to die!</b>

16:13.380 --> 16:15.460
<b>DIE!</b>

16:19.960 --> 16:22.540
<b>The spirit's not in him anymore,
but he's still acting like it...</b>

16:23.380 --> 16:27.460
<b>I'm betting there's something about him
that made the spirit want to possess him...</b>

16:27.790 --> 16:33.960
<b>But now that I'm here, I'm not about to let him get away!</b>

16:42.330 --> 16:44.790
<b>Sh-she took down a grown man...!</b>

16:44.920 --> 16:47.670
<b>His real name's Machida.</b>

16:48.000 --> 16:53.330
<b>Reio Student Arrested for Club-Related Violence</b>

16:48.420 --> 16:52.630
<b>He was arrested, but released on a suspended sentence.</b>

16:53.330 --> 16:56.500
<b>When he got back to the real world,
people started treating him as no more than a criminal,</b>

16:56.500 --> 16:58.330
<b>so he lost all faith in humanity.</b>

16:59.420 --> 17:02.750
<b>And it was that anger he had for them
that got him possessed...</b>

17:03.540 --> 17:07.920
<b>If you want to die,
don't drag other people along with you.</b>

17:09.380 --> 17:14.920
<b>The choice to ruin or end a life
belongs to the person living that life.</b>

17:22.080 --> 17:24.170
<b>The police can handle this from here.</b>

17:24.790 --> 17:25.540
<b>Book it!</b>

17:25.540 --> 17:26.380
<b>As fast as you can!</b>

17:26.380 --> 17:29.000
<b>Hey, wait for me!</b>

17:32.130 --> 17:34.960
<b>Keitaro, I'm glad you're okay.</b>

17:35.880 --> 17:37.580
<b>Yeah, same. Thanks.</b>

17:37.750 --> 17:38.920
<b>Glad to help!</b>

17:39.540 --> 17:43.420
<b>We lucked out. If he'd burned charcoal
in there, you'd be dead.</b>

17:44.210 --> 17:45.130
<b>You're right.</b>

17:45.880 --> 17:50.670
<b>Carbon monoxide poisoning is usually how
group suicides go, so why'd he chose hanging instead?</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:06.540
<b>Kei-kun? What's wrong?</b>

18:07.290 --> 18:11.710
<b>It's weird... I-I've never felt this before.</b>

18:12.420 --> 18:18.380
<b>I felt a ghost, or something, just appear,
then all of the sudden, it was gone.</b>

18:18.380 --> 18:22.830
<b>Keitaro, remember what I told you
about spirits killing other spirits?</b>

18:23.170 --> 18:25.460
<b>Yeah, why?</b>

18:25.830 --> 18:28.920
<b>Technically, spirits are already dead.
They can't die again.</b>

18:28.920 --> 18:32.380
<b>Okay, but what does that have to do with this?</b>

18:32.920 --> 18:37.000
<b>Well, spirits lose energy over time</b>

18:33.750 --> 18:37.420
<b>RIGHT AFTER DEATH</b>

18:37.250 --> 18:39.330
<b>and eventually pass on.</b>

18:37.420 --> 18:39.330
<b>PASS ON</b>

18:39.460 --> 18:44.540
<b>But some spirits don't want to pass on,
and try to linger in our world.</b>

18:44.960 --> 18:48.750
<b>To do that, they need more energy,
which they get from consuming other spirits.</b>

18:49.880 --> 18:53.420
<b>The consumed spirits don't die,
but provide their energy to the predator spirit,</b>

18:53.920 --> 18:58.170
<b>becoming all but "dead" once again.</b>

18:58.750 --> 19:00.880
<b>That's what happens when a spirit 'kills' another.</b>

19:01.380 --> 19:03.130
<b>As for what you just felt...</b>

19:03.210 --> 19:05.210
<b>MACHIDA</b>

19:04.670 --> 19:07.420
<b>The guy Nagayama was possessing, that Machida guy?</b>

19:07.960 --> 19:09.080
<b>Just killed himself.</b>

19:09.960 --> 19:10.750
<b>What?!</b>

19:11.000 --> 19:15.540
<b>You asked why he chose hanging instead.</b>

19:17.460 --> 19:18.460
<b>Now I know why.</b>

19:22.580 --> 19:25.540
<b>It put their body at the right height to devour their guts.</b>

19:26.130 --> 19:30.830
<b>When you felt the spirit appear,
that was the moment Machida died.</b>

19:31.080 --> 19:32.790
<b>When he disappeared, he'd been devoured.</b>

19:33.000 --> 19:36.000
<b>Nagayama orchestrated the group suicides
to consume the souls of the dead</b>

19:36.750 --> 19:40.710
<b>so he could stay in the world of the living.</b>

19:42.500 --> 19:43.210
<b>We're leaving.</b>

19:43.580 --> 19:45.080
<b>Yayoi-chan?!</b>

19:46.580 --> 19:51.420
<b>This one's devoured over a hundred souls.
She'd be the perfect snack.</b>

19:53.630 --> 19:56.750
<b>That day, an urban legend came to a quiet end...</b>

19:58.170 --> 20:02.170
<b>There shouldn't be any more suicides
at Complex T anymore.</b>

20:03.500 --> 20:08.960
<b>The students he'd tried to kill
were rescued from certain death.</b>

20:10.170 --> 20:13.670
<b>And we bolted out of there
before the first responders showed up.</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:17.580
<b>Talk about a welcome party...</b>

20:18.170 --> 20:22.750
<b>Instead of making friends,
I got sucked into another supernatural adventure...</b>

20:22.880 --> 20:25.830
<b>Not that I was doing a great job
making friends in the first place.</b>

20:25.830 --> 20:28.380
<b>Y-you gave it a shot, and that's what counts!</b>

20:28.790 --> 20:33.540
<b>Keitaro, making friends is S-rank tough.
You're gonna die a lot before you win.</b>

20:33.540 --> 20:34.920
<b>I'd rather not die, thanks!</b>

20:36.750 --> 20:42.040
<b>I feel like I've had way more ghost stuff
to worry about this year already...</b>

20:42.670 --> 20:47.420
<b>Spirits are naturally drawn to you.
It's gonna be tough avoiding the supernatural.</b>

20:48.630 --> 20:52.920
<b>You'd be better off learning how to deal with them
when you run into them.</b>

20:53.670 --> 20:54.790
<b>She's right.</b>

20:54.790 --> 20:59.880
<b>If I'm gonna be stuck with them,
I might as well learn how to handle incidents myself.</b>

21:00.380 --> 21:05.250
<b>I'll get rid of the curse and be able to live a normal life
without fearing any ghost attacks.</b>

21:06.130 --> 21:10.380
<b>And I'll be able to protect not only myself,
but the people I love, too.</b>

21:11.290 --> 21:15.920
<b>But... do I really have what it takes?</b>

21:17.790 --> 21:20.790
<b>Can I face my fears head-on...</b>

21:22.750 --> 21:24.210
<b>...like she does?</b>

21:25.250 --> 21:27.130
<b>I'll teach you everything you need to know.</b>

21:28.290 --> 21:32.170
<b>Wow, Yayoi-chan, you're gonna be the sexy tutor now?</b>

21:32.460 --> 21:33.750
<b>You know it, babe.</b>

21:35.880 --> 21:39.920
<b>Wait a sec, how did you guys know I needed help?</b>

21:39.920 --> 21:41.130
<b>Gulp!</b>

21:41.420 --> 21:43.540
<b>I didn't tell you where I was gonna be.</b>

21:45.580 --> 21:48.000
<b>Call it... a woman's intuition.</b>

21:49.290 --> 21:52.380
<b>Wow, Yayoi-chan! I didn't know you could do that, too!</b>

21:52.670 --> 21:54.210
<b>I literally just made that up.</b>

21:54.630 --> 21:56.580
<b>But he ate it up!</b>

21:57.880 --> 22:00.830
<b>I'm lucky I have you girls to help, then!</b>

23:32.330 --> 23:37.040
<b>Keitaro, Eiko, and Yayoi decide to go camping.</b>

23:37.380 --> 23:41.790
<b>Amidst the swaying greenery,
the babbling river, and the crackling fire,</b>

23:42.330 --> 23:47.670
<b>their distance is closed,
and hidden emotions are quietly revealed.</b>

23:48.500 --> 23:50.630
<b>But danger lurks nearby...</b>
